{"id":"94ce4cc247b1553c","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-ground-term-model-initial.md","title":"基项模型实现初始代数语义","display":"thm-ground-term-model-initial — 基项模型实现初始代数语义","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-ground-term-model-initial","aliases":["56-thm-ground-term-model-initial"],"display":"thm-ground-term-model-initial — 基项模型实现初始代数语义","depends_on":["[[56-thm-term-model-satisfies-equations]]","[[56-thm-ground-term-algebra-initial]]","[[56-thm-quotient-homomorphism-factorization]]","[[56-df-initial-algebra]]","[[56-thm-birkhoff-completeness]]"],"source_section":"7.2.5; 7.1.15","source_pages":"264; 267","source_ocr_blocks":[285,288],"source_statement_status":"source-exercise-compared; local-proof-expanded","source_proof_status":"local-factorization-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-ground-term-model-initial"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-ground-term-model-initial</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ground-term-model-initial — 基项模型实现初始代数语义"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b2200b3a7e14635b\" href=\"?note=b2200b3a7e14635b\" title=\"56-thm-term-model-satisfies-equations\">56-thm-term-model-satisfies-equations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6efb0e699c13a985\" href=\"?note=6efb0e699c13a985\" title=\"56-thm-ground-term-algebra-initial\">56-thm-ground-term-algebra-initial</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5f19d760d9e98dce\" href=\"?note=5f19d760d9e98dce\" title=\"56-thm-quotient-homomorphism-factorization\">56-thm-quotient-homomorphism-factorization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a0a8374d48d26bd5\" href=\"?note=a0a8374d48d26bd5\" title=\"56-df-initial-algebra\">56-df-initial-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"df0697d1c421b1e1\" href=\"?note=df0697d1c421b1e1\" title=\"56-thm-birkhoff-completeness\">56-thm-birkhoff-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.2.5; 7.1.15"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"264; 267"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>285</span><span>288</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-exercise-compared; local-proof-expanded"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-factorization-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq T^2\">\\(E\\subseteq T^2\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}\">\\(Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_G=Q\\cap G^2\">\\(Q_G=Q\\cap G^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{GTM}(\\Sigma,V,E)=(G/Q_G,I_{G,Q})\">\\(\\mathbf{GTM}(\\Sigma,V,E)=(G/Q_G,I_{G,Q})\\)</span>。模型与初始性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b2200b3a7e14635b\" href=\"?note=b2200b3a7e14635b\" title=\"56-thm-term-model-satisfies-equations\">56-thm-term-model-satisfies-equations</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a0a8374d48d26bd5\" href=\"?note=a0a8374d48d26bd5\" title=\"56-df-initial-algebra\">56-df-initial-algebra</a>；等式语义健全性取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"df0697d1c421b1e1\" href=\"?note=df0697d1c421b1e1\" title=\"56-thm-birkhoff-completeness\">56-thm-birkhoff-completeness</a> 的正向蕴涵。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(G/Q_G,I_{G,Q}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(G/Q_G,I_{G,Q}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Exercise 7.2.5；原书要求读者写出证明，本节点记录本地推导。基项模型满足E已由Proposition 7.1.13保证。对任意模型(B,J)，基项代数初始性给出唯一求值同态h:G→B。若s Q_G t，等式健全性使其在(B,J)中解释相等；基项的解释不依赖赋值，所以h(s)=h(t)。因子同态引理给出商到B的同态。任一此同态与商投影复合都是基项代数到B的同态，由前者唯一性和投影满射得到商同态唯一性。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003，7.2.5; 7.1.15，印刷页 264; 267。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 为本地DjVu文字层页块序号，不是物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-thm-term-model-satisfies-equations","status":"resolved","id":"b2200b3a7e14635b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-term-model-satisfies-equations]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-ground-term-algebra-initial","status":"resolved","id":"6efb0e699c13a985","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-ground-term-algebra-initial]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-quotient-homomorphism-factorization","status":"resolved","id":"5f19d760d9e98dce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-quotient-homomorphism-factorization]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-initial-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a0a8374d48d26bd5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-initial-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-birkhoff-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"df0697d1c421b1e1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-birkhoff-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-term-model-satisfies-equations","status":"resolved","id":"b2200b3a7e14635b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$、$E\\subseteq T^2$。令 $G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)\\ne\\varnothing$，$Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}$、$Q_G=Q\\cap G^2$，$\\mathbf{GTM}(\\Sigma,V,E)=(G/Q_G,I_{G,Q})$。模型与初始性见 [[56-thm-term-model-satisfies-equations]]、[[56-df-initial-algebra]]；等式语义健全性取 [[56-thm-birkhoff-completeness]] 的正向蕴涵。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-initial-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a0a8374d48d26bd5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$、$E\\subseteq T^2$。令 $G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)\\ne\\varnothing$，$Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}$、$Q_G=Q\\cap G^2$，$\\mathbf{GTM}(\\Sigma,V,E)=(G/Q_G,I_{G,Q})$。模型与初始性见 [[56-thm-term-model-satisfies-equations]]、[[56-df-initial-algebra]]；等式语义健全性取 [[56-thm-birkhoff-completeness]] 的正向蕴涵。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-birkhoff-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"df0697d1c421b1e1","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$、$E\\subseteq T^2$。令 $G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)\\ne\\varnothing$，$Q=\\equiv_E^{\\Sigma,V}$、$Q_G=Q\\cap G^2$，$\\mathbf{GTM}(\\Sigma,V,E)=(G/Q_G,I_{G,Q})$。模型与初始性见 [[56-thm-term-model-satisfies-equations]]、[[56-df-initial-algebra]]；等式语义健全性取 [[56-thm-birkhoff-completeness]] 的正向蕴涵。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"Q=\\equiv_E^{\\S